### SkatePod API sample requests
### Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension (or IntelliJ) and click "Send Request".
### The IDs below come from the dev sample data.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### List all students (with each one's next lesson)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students

### Get one student (Emma)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/11111111-1111-1111-1111-000000000001

### List disciplines and their levels (what the app's dropdowns show)
GET {{baseUrl}}/disciplines

### Create a student (disciplines can also be left out or empty)
POST {{baseUrl}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mai",
  "focus": "Waltz jump",
  "progress": 20,
  "disciplines": [
    { "discipline": "ADULT_FREESKATE", "level": "Adult Bronze" },
    { "discipline": "PATTERN_DANCE", "level": "Bronze" }
  ]
}

### Validation error example (blank name, progress over 100) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "progress": 150
}

### Level from another discipline → 400 (Juvenile isn't a Standard Freeskate level)
POST {{baseUrl}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mai",
  "progress": 20,
  "disciplines": [
    { "discipline": "STANDARD_FREESKATE", "level": "Juvenile" }
  ]
}

### Update a student (the disciplines list replaces the old one)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/students/11111111-1111-1111-1111-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Emma Miller",
  "focus": "Double flip",
  "progress": 80,
  "disciplines": [
    { "discipline": "STANDARD_FREESKATE", "level": "Gold" },
    { "discipline": "STANDARD_SKILLS", "level": "Gold" }
  ]
}

### List all lessons in calendar order
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons

### List one student's lessons
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons?studentId=11111111-1111-1111-1111-000000000001

### Schedule a lesson
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-000000000004",
  "date": "2026-11-06",
  "startTime": "16:30",
  "durationMinutes": 45,
  "type": "Freestyle",
  "color": "TEAL"
}

### Invalid lesson type example → 400 (only Public, Freestyle or Off-ice)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-000000000004",
  "date": "2026-11-06",
  "startTime": "16:30",
  "durationMinutes": 45,
  "type": "Moves",
  "color": "SAND"
}

### Not found example → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Delete a lesson
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/lessons/22222222-2222-2222-2222-000000000007
